  "releaseNotes": "- Added TryGetValueFromEndPoint and TryGetValueFromEndPointResult to the RSEndpoint class.\n\t\t  - Added withTransaction As Boolean? parameter to the ExecSQL and ExecSQLReader methods in DataAccess.\n\t\t  - Added ct As CancellationToken parameter to asynchronous methods in DataAccess.\n\t\t  - Added returnType As DataAccessReturnType parameter to the ExecSQLReader method in DataAccess.\n\t\t  - Adjusted the naming of the SetConnection method.\n\t\t  - Changed the default connectionTimeOut from 10 to 30 seconds.\n\t\t  - Added properties RowCount As Integer, TableName As String, Status As DataAccessStatus, and FireInfoMessageEventOnUserErrors to DataAccess.\n\t\t  - Added the CreateInputOutPutParam method to DataAccess.",
